                {
                  "name": "batch",
                  "item": [
                    {
                      "name": "Ingest telemetry batch from on-prem instance",
                      "id": "d53c0211-9a34-42b2-ad6c-e110671d274f",
                      "protocolProfileBehavior": {
                        "disableBodyPruning": true
                      },
                      "request": {
                        "method": "POST",
                        "header": [
                          {
                            "description": "On-prem instance ID",
                            "key": "x-instance-id",
                            "value": "<string>"
                          },
                          {
                            "description": "HMAC signature",
                            "key": "x-compresr-signature",
                            "value": "<string>"
                          },
                          {
                            "description": "(Required) ",
                            "key": "X-API-Key",
                            "value": "<string>"
                          },
                          {
                            "key": "Content-Type",
                            "value": "application/json"
                          },
                          {
                            "key": "Accept",
                            "value": "application/json"
                          }
                        ],
                        "body": {
                          "mode": "raw",
                          "raw": "{\n  \"batch_id\": \"<string>\",\n  \"instance_id\": \"<string>\",\n  \"events\": [\n    {\n      \"event_id\": \"<string>\",\n      \"timestamp\": \"<string>\",\n      \"event_type\": \"<string>\",\n      \"model_name\": \"<string>\",\n      \"original_tokens\": 0,\n      \"compressed_tokens\": 0,\n      \"tokens_saved\": 0,\n      \"duration_ms\": 0,\n      \"metadata\": {\n        \"id_8\": 86177334.37270224\n      },\n      \"event_hmac\": \"4ce4ec25cf3a0210010e76a90f87b9357c8aa0887d53bad4a58947d3cc5dc64c\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"identity\": {\n    \"instance_id\": \"<string>\",\n    \"api_key_hash\": \"a3bf33df9c8b28147312d1f9f7ae0df65886cb4dde0ccc6ec0b548bda2ba7757\",\n    \"created_at\": \"<string>\"\n  },\n  \"signing_secret\": \"<string>\"\n}",
                          "options": {
                            "raw": {
                              "headerFamily": "json",
                              "language": "json"
                            }
                          }
                        },
                        "url": {
                          "raw": "{{baseUrl}}/api/v1/telemetry/batch",
                          "host": [
                            "{{baseUrl}}"
                          ],
                          "path": [
                            "api",
                            "v1",
                            "telemetry",
                            "batch"
                          ]
                        },
                        "description": "Receive and store a batch of telemetry events from an on-prem Compresr instance.\n\n**Required Headers:**\n- `X-API-Key`: Compresr API key (authentication)\n- `X-Compresr-Signature`: HMAC signature (integrity)\n\n**Optional Headers:**\n- `X-Instance-ID`: On-prem instance identifier\n\n**First Request (auto-registration):**\nInclude `signing_secret` (`opm_xxx`) in the body - it will be registered\nautomatically. The on-prem image generates this credential itself; `cmp_`\nAPI keys are rejected.\n\n**Signature Format:**\n```\nt=timestamp,v1=HMAC-SHA256(timestamp + \".\" + JSON(payload), signing_secret)\n```\n\n**Event Types:**\n- `compression`: Counted for billing\n- `error`: Logged only\n- `startup`/`shutdown`: Operational\n\n**Idempotency:**\nSame batch_id within 24h returns success without reprocessing. A batch\nwith failed events stays replayable: retry it and already-billed events\nare returned as status \"duplicate\" (never billed twice)."
                      },
